{"unit_id": "tag:008C:prose-0003", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>为<MATH_0002>上的预层（presheaf），以集合（sets）为取值。\n<TEXTITOPEN_0001>拉回预层（pullback presheaf）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001><MATH_0003>对应于给定的预层（presheaf）<MATH_0004>，定义为左伴随（left adjoint），所伴随的是直像（pushforward）<MATH_0005>在预层（presheaves）上的作用。\n换言之，它应为预层（presheaf）<MATH_0006>，定义在<MATH_0007>上，且满足\n<MATH_0008>\n由米田引理（Yoneda lemma）可知，这唯一确定了拉回（pullback）。\n事实上，它确实存在。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "pullback presheaf", "target_term": "拉回预层"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "left adjoint", "target_term": "左伴随"}, {"source_term": "pushforward", "target_term": "直像"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "Yoneda lemma", "target_term": "米田引理"}, {"source_term": "pullback", "target_term": "拉回"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "指给定空间上的取值为集合的预层。"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合", "context": "指起初所给预层的取值对象。"}, {"source_term": "pullback presheaf", "target_term": "拉回预层", "context": "指通过伴随性质定义的预层。"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "指待取拉回的给定预层。"}, {"source_term": "left adjoint", "target_term": "左伴随", "context": "指用以定义拉回的伴随关系。"}, {"source_term": "pushforward", "target_term": "直像", "context": "指在预层上与拉回构成伴随的操作。"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层", "context": "指出此处直像所作用的对象。"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "指应当满足所列公式的对象。"}, {"source_term": "Yoneda lemma", "target_term": "米田引理", "context": "指用来推出唯一性的引理。"}, {"source_term": "pullback", "target_term": "拉回", "context": "指由前面的条件唯一确定的对象。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:008F:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为连续映射（map）。\n存在函子（functor）\n<MATH_0002>\n它是<MATH_0003>的左伴随（left adjoint）。对于预层（presheaf）<MATH_0004>，它由下式确定：\n<MATH_0005>\n其中，取余极限（colimit）所用的开邻域（open neighbourhoods）<MATH_0006>遍及<MATH_0007>在<MATH_0008>中的所有此类邻域。这些余极限（colimits）都取在有向偏序集（partially ordered sets）上。\n（<MATH_0009>的限制映射（restriction mappings）在证明中说明。）\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "left adjoint", "target_term": "左伴随"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "colimit", "target_term": "余极限"}, {"source_term": "open neighbourhoods", "target_term": "开邻域"}, {"source_term": "colimits", "target_term": "余极限"}, {"source_term": "partially ordered sets", "target_term": "偏序集"}, {"source_term": "restriction mappings", "target_term": "限制映射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指引理所假定的连续映射。"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "指引理断言存在的函子。"}, {"source_term": "left adjoint", "target_term": "左伴随", "context": "指该函子相对于给定函子的伴随性质。"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "指公式所作用的给定对象。"}, {"source_term": "colimit", "target_term": "余极限", "context": "指公式中以开邻域为指标的余极限。"}, {"source_term": "open neighbourhoods", "target_term": "开邻域", "context": "指给定空间中用作指标的开邻域。"}, {"source_term": "colimits", "target_term": "余极限", "context": "指这些公式中在有向偏序集上取的余极限。"}, {"source_term": "partially ordered sets", "target_term": "偏序集", "context": "指这些余极限的有向指标集。"}, {"source_term": "restriction mappings", "target_term": "限制映射", "context": "指将在证明中说明如何得到的映射。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:008F:proof", "translation": "余极限（colimit）取在如下偏序集（partially ordered set）上：它由开子集（open subsets）<MATH_0001>中包含<MATH_0002>者组成，按反向包含（inclusion）排序。\n这是一个有向偏序集（directed partially ordered set），因为若<MATH_0003>属于其中，则<MATH_0004>也属于其中。\n此外，若<MATH_0005>，则<MATH_0006>的每个开邻域（open neighbourhood）也是<MATH_0007>的开邻域（open neighbourhood）。\n因此，定义<MATH_0008>的系统（system）是定义<MATH_0009>所用系统的子系统（subsystem），从而得到一个限制映射（map）（例如，可应用《范畴（Categories）》一章引理<REF_0001>中的一般性结论）。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n注意，余极限（colimit）的构造显然关于<MATH_0010>具有函子性（functorial），限制映射（restriction mappings）也是如此。\n因此，我们已将<MATH_0011>定义为函子（functor）。\n\n<STRUCT_0003><STRUCT_0004>\n有一条简短（small）而有用的注记：存在典范映射（canonical map）<MATH_0012>，因为由开邻域（open neighbourhoods）组成的系统（system）所对应的是<MATH_0013>，且其中包含元素（element）<MATH_0014>。它与限制映射（restriction mappings）相容。换言之，存在典范映射（canonical map）<MATH_0015>。\n\n<STRUCT_0005><STRUCT_0006>\n设<MATH_0016>为<MATH_0017>上的预层（presheaf），以集合（sets）为取值。\n设<MATH_0018>是映射（map），其源和目标均为取值为集合的预层（presheaves of sets）。相应的映射（map）<MATH_0019>就是映射（map）<MATH_0020>。\n\n<STRUCT_0007><STRUCT_0008>\n还有一条简短（small）而有用的注记：存在典范映射（canonical map）<MATH_0021>。\n具体而言，设<MATH_0022>为开集（open）。\n对每个开邻域（open neighbourhood）<MATH_0023>（在<MATH_0024>中），都存在映射（map）\n<MATH_0025>，\n即<MATH_0026>上的限制映射（map）。它与各个取值之间的限制映射（restriction mappings）相容，这些取值是<MATH_0027>在<MATH_0028>遍及包含<MATH_0029>的开集（opens）时所得的。\n因此，得到典范映射（canonical map）<MATH_0030>。\n再作一项直接验证即知，这些映射（maps）与限制映射（maps）相容，并定义了映射（map）<MATH_0031>，其源和目标均为取值为集合的预层（presheaves of sets）。\n\n<STRUCT_0009><STRUCT_0010>\n设<MATH_0032>是映射（map），其源和目标均为取值为集合的预层（presheaves of sets）。考虑<MATH_0033>。\n在其后复合（Postcomposing）<MATH_0034>即得所需的映射（map）\n<MATH_0035>。\n我们略去如下验证：此构造是上文所给反向构造的逆（inverse）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "colimit", "target_term": "余极限"}, {"source_term": "partially ordered set", "target_term": "偏序集"}, {"source_term": "open subsets", "target_term": "开子集"}, {"source_term": "inclusion", "target_term": "包含"}, {"source_term": "directed partially ordered set", "target_