{"unit_id": "tag:008G:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为连续映射（map）。\n设<MATH_0002>。设<MATH_0003>为<MATH_0004>上的预层（presheaf），以集合（sets）为取值。\n存在如下典范（canonical）双射（bijection），其两端均为茎（stalks）：\n<MATH_0005>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范"}, {"source_term": "bijection", "target_term": "双射"}, {"source_term": "stalks", "target_term": "茎"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指引理开头假定的连续映射。"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "指给定空间上取值为集合的预层。"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合", "context": "指给定预层的取值对象。"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范", "context": "描述式中双射的典范性。"}, {"source_term": "bijection", "target_term": "双射", "context": "指引理断言存在的一一对应。"}, {"source_term": "stalks", "target_term": "茎", "context": "指该典范双射两端的对象。"}], "notes": []}
