{"unit_id": "tag:008C:prose-0004", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>为<MATH_0002>上的层（sheaf），以集合（sets）为取值。\n<TEXTITOPEN_0001>拉回层（pullback sheaf）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001><MATH_0003>由下式定义：\n<MATH_0004>\n拉回（pullback）<MATH_0005>是左伴随（left adjoint），所伴随的是直像（pushforward）在层（sheaves）上的作用。换言之，\n<MATH_0006>\n具体而言，有\n<MATH_0007>\n第一个等式（equality）用到如下事实：层化（sheafification）是左伴随（left adjoint），所伴随的包含（inclusion）将层（sheaves）纳入预层（presheaves）。第二个等式（equality）用到<MATH_0008>是<MATH_0009>的左伴随（left adjoint），此伴随关系在预层（presheaves）上成立。我们将在引理<REF_0001>的证明中再次讨论这一陈述。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "pullback sheaf", "target_term": "拉回层"}, {"source_term": "pullback", "target_term": "拉回"}, {"source_term": "left adjoint", "target_term": "左伴随"}, {"source_term": "pushforward", "target_term": "直像"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "equality", "target_term": "等式"}, {"source_term": "sheafification", "target_term": "层化"}, {"source_term": "left adjoint", "target_term": "左伴随"}, {"source_term": "inclusion", "target_term": "包含"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "equality", "target_term": "等式"}, {"source_term": "left adjoint", "target_term": "左伴随"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "指给定空间上的取值为集合的层。"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合", "context": "指给定层的取值对象。"}, {"source_term": "pullback sheaf", "target_term": "拉回层", "context": "指由紧随其后的公式定义的层。"}, {"source_term": "pullback", "target_term": "拉回", "context": "指对层取拉回的操作。"}, {"source_term": "left adjoint", "target_term": "左伴随", "context": "描述拉回相对于层上直像的伴随性质。"}, {"source_term": "pushforward", "target_term": "直像", "context": "指在层上与拉回构成伴随的操作。"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "指出直像在此处作用于层。"}, {"source_term": "equality", "target_term": "等式", "context": "指所列公式中的第一个等式。"}, {"source_term": "sheafification", "target_term": "层化", "context": "指用于推出第一个等式的伴随操作。"}, {"source_term": "left adjoint", "target_term": "左伴随", "context": "描述层化相对于包含的伴随性质。"}, {"source_term": "inclusion", "target_term": "包含", "context": "指将层视为预层的包含。"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "指该包含所作用的对象。"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层", "context": "指该包含所得到的对象所属的范畴。"}, {"source_term": "equality", "target_term": "等式", "context": "指所列公式中的第二个等式。"}, {"source_term": "left adjoint", "target_term": "左伴随", "context": "指用于推出第二个等式的伴随关系。"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层", "context": "指出后一伴随关系在预层上成立。"}], "notes": []}
